{"tool_name":"pyxit-object-classification-prediction","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>This module is for applying classification models on objects.&nbsp;It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotation images and coordinate of annotated objects from project(s) and build a annotation classification model which is saved locally. It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotations images from an image (e.g. detected by an object finder), apply a classification model (previously saved locally), and uploads to Cytomine-Core annotation terms (in a userjob layer).</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>This module is for applying classification models on objects.&nbsp;It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotation images and coordinate of annotated objects from project(s) and build a annotation classification model which is saved locally. It downloads from Cytomine-Core annotations images from an image (e.g. detected by an object finder), apply a classification model (previously saved locally), and uploads to Cytomine-Core annotation terms (in a userjob layer).</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-18T16:55:36+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-13T12:14:17+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505227265,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Rapha\u00ebl Mar\u00e9e"},{"value":"Gilles Louppe"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":169,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"ef338f80-91e0-4e5e-8790-ba24ae312b45","url":"/user/169"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4186,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__RDetoixS3xEu0agR2CebaoB","url":"/pattern-recognition"}],"has_i